    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cLots of Cats on an Adventure\u201d is a game where you find hidden cats in comic strips, meow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a peaceful day, humans (a.k.a. cat servants) were abducted by aliens! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One brave cat couldn\u2019t just sit back and watch, so they set off on an adventure to gather a crew to rescue their beloved humans\u2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the cats hidden in the beautiful and diverse hand-drawn landscapes, and join the cat friends on their wacky adventure, meow!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find Over 2200 Cats and Special Items!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part 1 (free): 5+1 main landscapes, 5 interactable comic strips, 850+ cats, 250 items</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part 2 (DLC): 5+1 main landscapes, 5 interactable comic strips, 850+ cats, 250 items</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All comic strips and main landscapes are connected through story progression.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hints can be used once per minute.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No penalty for clicking on a spot without a cat. Search freely.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Has an original soundtrack, with unique tracks featured in each episode. Another BGM set is also available, so you can choose the one that you like best.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777270/extras/a86aadf41d7382e96ed0339ed77da318.poster.avif?t=1753117885\" width=580 height=580 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777270/extras/a86aadf41d7382e96ed0339ed77da318.webm?t=1753117885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777270/extras/a86aadf41d7382e96ed0339ed77da318.mp4?t=1753117885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777270/extras/0240c2e3e3db0e6498f5e0dbd70bdc1e.poster.avif?t=1753117885\" width=580 height=580 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777270/extras/0240c2e3e3db0e6498f5e0dbd70bdc1e.webm?t=1753117885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777270/extras/0240c2e3e3db0e6498f5e0dbd70bdc1e.mp4?t=1753117885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u201cLots of Cats on an Adventure\u201d is a game where you find hidden cats in comic strips, meow!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a peaceful day, humans (a.k.a. cat servants) were abducted by aliens! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One brave cat couldn\u2019t just sit back and watch, so they set off on an adventure to gather a crew to rescue their beloved humans\u2026.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Find the cats hidden in the beautiful and diverse hand-drawn landscapes, and join the cat friends on their wacky adventure, meow!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Find Over 2200 Cats and Special Items!</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part 1 (free): 5+1 main landscapes, 5 interactable comic strips, 850+ cats, 250 items</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Part 2 (DLC): 5+1 main landscapes, 5 interactable comic strips, 850+ cats, 250 items</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Main Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >All comic strips and main landscapes are connected through story progression.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hints can be used once per minute.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >No penalty for clicking on a spot without a cat. Search freely.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Has an original soundtrack, with unique tracks featured in each episode. Another BGM set is also available, so you can choose the one that you like best.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777270/extras/a86aadf41d7382e96ed0339ed77da318.poster.avif?t=1753117885\" width=580 height=580 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777270/extras/a86aadf41d7382e96ed0339ed77da318.webm?t=1753117885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777270/extras/a86aadf41d7382e96ed0339ed77da318.mp4?t=1753117885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777270/extras/0240c2e3e3db0e6498f5e0dbd70bdc1e.poster.avif?t=1753117885\" width=580 height=580 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777270/extras/0240c2e3e3db0e6498f5e0dbd70bdc1e.webm?t=1753117885\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3777270/extras/0240c2e3e3db0e6498f5e0dbd70bdc1e.mp4?t=1753117885\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>",
